   "description": "This region is mainly know for its deletion that causes Prader-Willi syndrome (PWS) and Angelman syndrome (AS). Due to methylation patterns however, different genes are responsible for the two syndromes. For this chromosomal region, also duplications are known.  A detailed description of the syndromes in this region and the molecular pathway has been published by Ehrhart et al., 2017 .",
