     "name": "Thrombocytopenia-absent radius syndrome",
     "description": "A rare congenital malformation syndrome characterized by bilateral absence/hypoplasia of the radii with presence of both thumbs, and thrombocytopenia. Additional manifestations can include cow's milk allergy, anomalies of the lower limbs, heart and genitourinary system.",
