   "description": "RB1CC1, located on chromosome 8q11.23, is mainly involved in autophagy regulation (MIM#606837). A loss of function or mutation in the gene can result in increased risk for schizophrenia (Degenhardt et al., 2013; Errichiello et al., 2020).",
   "hasBioChemEntityPart": [
